    alias: Alektronnik
repository-code: "https://github.com/Alektronnik/M4TH"
url: "https://github.com/Alektronnik/M4TH"
abstract: >
  Self-contained formalisation in Lean 4 over Mathlib of elementary PDE theory,
  analytic number theory, gauge theory, lattice field theory, and arithmetic
  geometry. Fifteen independent packages across five releases:
  v1.0.0 -- PDE (ConservationLaws, BurgersBlowUp, KdV).
  v2.0.0 -- Riemann-von Mangoldt (DirichletEta, ZetaZeroCounting, XiLogResidue,
  XiLogDeriv).
  v3.0.0 -- Meissel-Mertens constant, compensated prime harmonic convergence,
  conditional PNT+ closure (MertensPNT).
  v4.0.0 -- Argument principle over the critical box, asymptotic contour
  synthesis, discrete Abel-Chebyshev bridge (XiArgumentPrinciple,
  XiAsymptoticFrontier, DiscreteAbelChebyshev).
  v5.0.0 -- Concrete su(3), SU(3) Wilson positivity, certified elliptic curve
  5077a1, Sophie Germain prime-gap parity (SU3Concrete, SU3Wilson,
  CertifiedElliptic5077, PrimeGapsSophie).
  Zero axioms, zero sorry.
  Every headline theorem carries the clean axiom certificate [propext,
  Classical.choice, Quot.sound].
